 "_comment": [
  "FC->GCS decode-parity frames, generated ONCE by pymavlink (the oracle encoder).",
  "tests/test_contract_dualstack_state_parity.py re-encodes each spec at run time",
  "and asserts the checked-in hex still matches (regeneration guard), then feeds",
  "the SAME bytes through backend handle_* (real DroneLink + get_state()) and the",
  "TS WebSerial path (parseFrames -> dispatchFrame -> buildSerialHandlers) and",
  "compares the app.drone keys listed in `compare`. STATUSTEXT is intentionally",
  "absent: backend applies statustext filtering + locale, WebSerial passes raw."
